Package: vg-sales-analyzer
Type: Package
Title: video Game Sales Analyzer 
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
      person("Alen","Abraham", email = "Alenjaks123@yahoo.com",
      role = c("aut,"cre"))
Description: As mentioned in the description, this package analyzes data from 
#more than 16,500 games. With it, we are able to see information such as the 
#platform of the game, year of release, genre, publisher, and sales from 
#different regions. The intention is to see trends over time and the 
#relationship between regions and sales.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr
